1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/123308419/gunner-larson-amdall
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunner Amdall (aka Larson) was the son of Lars Johan Larsson Amdal (1791-1846) and Lisbet Nilsdtr Saua (1793-1853).
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunner and his family immigrated to America from Norway, arriving June 19, 1877, at Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, aboard the ship "Indiana".
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Martha Ovesdtr Mosbakka on July 5, 1847, at Sauda Kirke, Sauda, Rogaland, Norway. To this union the following children are known:
2 CONT - Elizabeth Gunnarsdtr Amdal (Mrs. Knute Danielson) (1849-1933)
2 CONT - Gunnar Larson Gundersen Amdal (1850-1894)
2 CONT - Ove Gunnarsson Amdal (1851-1937)
2 CONT - Lars Gunnarsson Amdall (1853-1941)
2 CONT - Ragnild Gunnarsdtr Amdall (Mrs. Peter Peterson) (1856-1951)
2 CONT - Anna Marie Gunnarsdatter Amdall (1857-1857)
2 CONT - Marta "Martha" Gunnarsdtr Amdal (1858-1891)
2 CONT - Anne Maria Gunnarsdtr Amdal (Mrs. Rasmus Anderson)(1861-1938)
2 CONT - Gunder (George) Gundersen Amdahl (1863-1935)
2 CONT - Knute Gunnarsson Amdahl (1866-10 Nov 1942, Swift county, Minnesota)
2 CONT - Sissel "Cecilia" Gunnarsdtr Amdal (1868-1905)
