1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/123308844/martha-amdall
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Ovesdatter Mosbakka Amdall BIRTH	1826 Norway DEATH	11 Dec 1895 (aged 68–69) Story County, Iowa, USA BURIAL	 Roland Cemetery Roland, Story County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Ove Tormodsen Mosbakka (1795-1868) and Ragnild Samuelsdatter Risvoll (1792-1878)
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha married Gunnar Larsen Amdal on July 5, 1847, in Sauda, Rogaland, Norway. To this union the following children are known to have been born: 1) Elizabeth Amdall (Mrs. Knute Danielson)(1849-1933) 2) Ove Gunnarsson Amdall (1851
2 CONC -1937) 3) Lars Gunnarsson Amdall (1853-1941) 4) Ragnild G. Amdall (Mrs. Peter Peterson)(1856-1951) 5) Martha Amdall (1858-1891) 6) Anna Marie Amdall (Mrs. Rasmus Anderson)(1861-1938) 7) Gunnar Amdall (1863-1935) 8) Knut Gunnarsson
2 CONC  Amdall (1868-1942) 9) Cecelia Gunnarsdotter Amdall (1868-1905)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notice of death, source: Story County Watchman, December 20, 1895. Transcribed by Dorian Myhre.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Roland Record: ....The tolling of the church bell this morning announced the death of Mrs. Martha Amdal, wife of Gunner Larson Amdal, deceased. Mrs. Amdal died last evening at 7 o'clock."
2 CONT
