2 CONT
2 CONT Immigrated to the United States from Norway in 1875.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Aasa "Ellen" Wicks in 1881. To this union the following children are known to have been born:
2 CONT 1) Clara Nerem (Mrs. George Cole)
2 CONT 2) Ingemore Nerem (23 Mar 1885-Nov 1965, Minnesota)
2 CONT 3) Tina Nerem (Mrs. Millang) (Aug 1886-)
2 CONT 4) Julia Nerem (Mrs. Hanson) (Aug 1888-)
2 CONT 5) Ada Nerem (Mrs. Millang)(Aug 1890-1978)
2 CONT 6) Nettie Bertina Nerem (Mrs. Henry I. Durby)(?-July 28, 1931)
2 CONT 7) Minelva Amanda Nerem (Mrs. Lura)(29 Feb 1896-)
2 CONT 8) Gerhard Nerem (born about 1899)
2 CONT 9) Susan Nerem (Mrs. Hill)
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary transcribed by Dena Gray-Fisher, source: Roland Record, February 24, 1938
2 CONT M. NEREIM IS DEAD
2 CONT Martin Nereim, 88, a resident of this community for about 50 years, died at 3:30 o'clock yesterday morning at the Story City hospital. He had been staying at the Old Peoples Home in Story City in recent years. The funeral will be 
2 CONC held Friday afternoon at 1:30 o'clock at the N. H. Millang home and at 2:00 o'clock in Salem Lutheran church.
