1 NOTE {geni:about_me} To America.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/125659944/ragnhild-teig
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnhild “Nellie” Ostherheim Raymond Teig BIRTH	30 Aug 1854 Sauda, Sauda kommune, Rogaland fylke, Norway DEATH	27 Jul 1913 (aged 58) Jackson County, Minnesota, USA BURIAL	 Roland Cemetery Howard Township, Story County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnhild was the daughter of Johannes "John" Larson Austarheim and Brita "Bertha" Endresdotter Åbø. According to family records, the family adopted the last name "Raymond or Raymen" after coming to America because their Norwegian 
2 CONC name was difficult for Americans to pronounce. The family immigrated to the United States from Norway in 1858. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1879, Ragnhild "Nellie" married Ole Knutson Teig. To this union the following children are known to have been born: 1) Christ "Chris" Teig (21 Jan 1881-1952; burial in Randall, Hamilton County, Iowa) 2) John Benhart Teig (9 Jan
2 CONC  1882-22 Apr 1955; burial Kelso, Cowlitz County, Washington) 3) Ole M. Teig (1 Oct 1885-Nov 1965) 4) Edward Teig (18 Aug 1888-19 Dec 1934; burial Portland, Multnomah County, Oregon) 5) Martin J. Teig (25 Sep 1889-1958; burial Stor
2 CONC y City Cemetery; Story City, Story County, Iowa) 6) Bella Matilda Teig (Mrs. Henry Tollefson)(25 Dec 1892-Oct 1974; burial Windom, Cottonwood County, Minn.)
2 CONT
