1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/95898245/mabel-sandvick
2 CONT
2 CONT Mabel Sandvick, 89, of Nevada died of a heart ailment Tuesday at the Story County Hospital Long-Term Card Unit. Services will be at 1:30 p.m. Friday at Salem Lutheran Church in Roland. Burial will be in Roland Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Sandvick, a homemaker, was born in Wisconsin and lived in McCallsburg and Roland much of her life. She was a member of the Lutheran Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving a son, August of Ankeny; a daughter, Ardie Amundson of Zearing; a sister, Clara Pearson of Story City; 15 grandchildren; 35 great-grandchildren; and eight great-great-grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Friends may call after 3 p.m. today at Soderstrum Funeral Home in Roland, where the family will be present from 6:30 to 8 p.m.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Des Moines Register. Des Moines, Iowa. Thursday, November 5, 1992.
2 CONT Provided by Find a Grave contributor: Jean Wilson (48841367)
