1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/137427608/maurice-albert-olson
2 CONT
2 CONT Maurice Albert “Maury” Olson
2 CONT BIRTH	9 Jan 1926
2 CONT Seattle, King County, Washington, USA
2 CONT DEATH	31 Jul 2013 (aged 87)
2 CONT Ballard, King County, Washington, USA
2 CONT BURIAL	
2 CONT Floral Hills Cemetery
2 CONT Lynnwood, Snohomish County, Washington, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Maurice (Maury) Albert Olson was born January 9, 1926 in Seattle, WA and grew up in the Ballard area. He passed away at home at the age 87 on July 31, 2013. He was the only child of Norwegian parents, Oscar and Myrtle (Rod). he gr
2 CONC aduated from Ballard HS in 1944 and enlisted in the Army Air Corps serving during World War II.
2 CONT
2 CONT After the war ended, he helped his dad run the family commercial fishing boat named "Puget" in the Alaskan waters.
2 CONT
2 CONT He loved the accordion and entertain folks with his Scandinavian polka music. He graduated from UW in 1954 proud Husky alumni. He had a 30 year career as Mgr of Cost Research for Boeing.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married for 52 years to the love of his life, Betty Jean, who passed away in 2019. He enjoyed travelling during his retirement years. His favorite past time was sitting in his chair, therefore nicknames The King.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by his two daughters, Wendy O'Toole (Bill) and Judy Norton (Brant) and was very proud of his 6 grandchildren and 3 great grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT A special thank you you goes out to caregivers Elizabeth, from The Health People, Special Friend Mary King and the many kind staff from Evergreen Hospice.
2 CONT
2 CONT In lieu of flowers, please make donations to The Salvation Army.
2 CONT A graveside service will be held at Floral Hills on Sept. 9, 2013 at 3 PM, followed by a reception in celebration of his life
2 CONT The Seattle Times, Sunday, August 18, 2013
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse
2 CONT
2 CONT Betty Jean Hollow Olson
2 CONT 1926–2010
