2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT Stoeckmann - Walter F., age 86, of Plymouth. Preceded in death by wife, Gladys; daughter, Joy Lynn. Survived by daughter, Wallis Stoeckmann; son, John Stoeckmann; granddaughter, Joy Lynn; sisters, Hilma Flynn, Bernice Pehling, Rut
2 CONC h Johnson; several other relatives and friends; a loving and dedicated husband, father and grandfather who will be greatly missed. Funeral service Friday, 11AM at WASHBURN-MCREAVY DUSCHENE CHAPEL, 4239 W. Broadway, Robbinsdale. Vi
2 CONC sitation Thursday 5-8PM and 1 hour prior to service at chapel. Interment Fort Snelling National Cemetery. If so desired, memorials may be made to American Cancer Society. Washburn-McReavy DuSchene Chapel 763-537-2333.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pioneer Press - June 19, 2002
