1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/147981521/betty-jean-olson
2 CONT
2 CONT Betty Jean Hollow Olson
2 CONT BIRTH	18 Nov 1926
2 CONT DEATH	29 Nov 2010 (aged 84)
2 CONT BURIAL	
2 CONT Floral Hills Cemetery
2 CONT Lynnwood, Snohomish County, Washington, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT At the age of 84, Betty Olson passed away peacefully on November 29, 2010 in her home while surrounded by family. She was born in Auburn, WA on November 18, 1926 to her late parents, John and Helen Hollow.
2 CONT She is survived by her loving husband of 52 years, Maurice A. Olson; daughters, Wendy O'Toole (William) and Jody Norton (Bryant); brother, Neil Hollow; sisters, Diana Whitney and Linda McLain (Tim); six grandchildren, Shayna, Kega
2 CONC n (Jenn) and Kelsey O'Toole, Ricky Villa, Trent and Tracy Norton and three great-grandchildren.
2 CONT Betty was preceded in death by her brother Dale Hollow.
2 CONT
2 CONT Betty was a wonderful wife, mother, grandmother and friend. Her sense of humor, laughter and glowing smile will be dearly missed by her family and friends. She enjoyed playing bridge and had achieved the status of Life Gold Master
2 CONC . She also took great pride in displaying her brightly-colored flower pots. Betty's Tradition: Reading aloud of every greeting card with lots of kisses (X) and hugs (O).
2 CONT
2 CONT A memorial service will be held at 11:00am on Monday, December 6, 2010 at Purdy & Walters at Floral Hills, 409 Filbert Rd in Lynnwood, with a visitation beginning at 10:00am in the chapel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse
2 CONT
2 CONT Maurice Albert Olson
2 CONT 1926–2013
