2 CONT
2 CONT Torkel Henryson BIRTH	27 Mar 1822 Etnesjoen, Etne kommune, Hordaland fylke, Norway DEATH	27 Jul 1911 (aged 89) Story City, Story County, Iowa, USA BURIAL	 Story City Cemetery Story City, Story County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Roland Record 17 August 1911
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Harvest of Story City People
2 CONT
2 CONT Torkel Henryson
2 CONT
2 CONT Torkel Henryson died at the home of his son, T. T. Henryson, at Story City, Iowa, on Thursday, July 27th. The deceased was born in Norway, March 27, 1822 and at his death had attained the ripe age of 89 years and six months. He ta
2 CONC ught school in Norway for a few years, after which he married Guro Gronstad, and together they set sail for America, settling in Kendall County, Illinois., where they lived for eighteen years, when they moved to Story City, arrivi
2 CONC ng at their destination July 1, 1865. From the first he was a leader in political and social matters in the newly settled country and was one of the first to get a Lutheran congregation organized at that place.
2 CONT
