2 CONT Torkel T. Henryson BIRTH	22 Jul 1861 Illinois, USA DEATH	9 May 1941 (aged 79) BURIAL	 Story City Cemetery Story City, Story County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT TORKEL T. HENRYSON was born on 22 Jul 1861 in Illinois. He died on 09 May 1941. He married (1) JULIA ERICKSON on 31 May 1884 in Story City, Story County, Iowa, daughter of Thor Erickson and Sarah. She was born about 1863 in Kendal
2 CONC l County, Illinois. She died on 13 Aug 1889. He married (2) INGEBORG SEVEREIDE, daughter of Erick Severeide and Maria Vinje. She was born on 21 Mar 1870 in Minnesota. She died on 21 Mar 1943.
2 CONT
