2 CONT Albert Bower memorial set for Saturday   March 1965
2 CONT A requiem Eucharist memorial service will be conducted for Albert F. Bower, 48, at 1 p.m. Saturday at St. John's Episcopal Church in Mason City.  The Rev. Franklin J. Klohn, director of the church, will conduct the service.
2 CONT Mr. Bower, formerly of Mason city and Clear Lake, died suddenly Sunday afternoon at Stockton, Calif., where he had been making his home the last three years.
2 CONT Funeral services were set for Thursday in Steven's Episcopal Church at Stockton.  Burial will be in Stockton.
