2 CONT First wife, Marta Olsdatter Hansane, died in April 1863 in Norway after giving birth. They had 5 known children together: Thomas (born Torbjørn), Ole, Isabell "Bell" (born Boel), John (born Jens), and an infant (b/d 16 April 1863)
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Thers and Bell (born Boel Olavsdatter) married 19 June 1864 in Kvinnherad kommune, Hordaland, Norway and had 5 children: Marta (b. 1864 Norway, d. 1865 Norway), Martha, Herborg "Hattie", Peter, and Bertha.
