2 CONT Sex: M 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Osmund Guggedal is named in tax lists from 1603 and 1605. He operated
2 CONT
2 CONT farms at Guggedal and Århus. It is probable that he owned all or part
2 CONT
2 CONT of Guggedal. His widow is named at the farm in 1610.
