2 PLAC Tveit, Erfjord, Rogaland
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hallvard Johannesson, son of Johannes Olson and Larsdotter, was born in 1658 in Underbakka, Suldal, Rogaland, NOR and died circa 1742 in Tveit, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR at age 84. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hallvard married Marta Paulsdotter circa 1683 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. They had no children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hallvard next married Joren Halvorsdotter on 19. Nov 1713 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i.  Marta Halvardsdotter (Twin). Marta married Ole Johannesson circa 1748 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.  Johannes Halvardson (Twin) was born in 1718 in Tveit, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR and died in 1784 in Tveit, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR at age 66. Johannes married Siri Olsdotter circa 1750 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii.  Synneva Halvardsdotter was born in 1721 in Tveit, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1803 in Østerhus, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR at age 82, and was buried on 1. May 1803 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Synn
2 CONC eva was Sønneva. Synneva married Peder Johannesson circa 1745 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. Synneva next married Paul Olson in 1759 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv.  Ildri Halvardsdotter was born in 1724 in Tveit, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR and died circa 1744 in Tveit, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR at age 20. 
2 CONT
2 CONT v.  Ole Halvardson was born in 1727 in Tveit, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR and died in 1758 in Tveit, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR at age 31. 
