1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 430. Jon Olson, son of Ole Endreson and Helga, was born in 1632 in Hiim, Sand, Rogaland, NOR and died circa 1682 in Hiim, Sand, Rogaland, NOR at age 50.  Jon married Elisabet Pålsdotter circa 1660 in Sand kyrkje, S
2 CONC and, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT           i.  Helga Jonsdotter was born in 1660 in Hiim, Sand, Rogaland, NOR and died in 1741 in Eide, Sand, Rogaland, NOR at age 81. Helga married Gunnar Gunnarson circa 1679 in Sand kyrkje, Sand, Rogaland, NOR. Helga next marrie
2 CONC d Haldor Styrkårson in 1681 in Sand kyrkje, Sand, Rogaland, NOR. Helga next married Anders Kjetilson in 1700 in Sand kyrkje, Sand, Rogaland, NOR. They had no children. 
2 CONT          ii.  Ingeborg Jonsdotter was born in 1661 in Hiim, Sand, Rogaland, NOR and died before 1748 in Helland, Sand, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Ingeborg was Ingebor. Ingeborg married Øystein Kjetilson on 6. Jan 1701 in Sand
2 CONC  kyrkje, Sand, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT         iii.  Pål Jonson was born in 1663 in Hiim, Sand, Rogaland, NOR and died in Søndenå, Sauda, Rogaland, NOR. Pål married Guro Torgersdotter circa 1690 in Suldal kyrkje, Suldal, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT          iv.  Ole Jonson was born in 1668 in Hiim, Sand, Rogaland, NOR and died in Underbakka, Suldal, Rogaland, NOR. Ole married Ingrid Torgersdotter circa 1690 in Suldal kyrkje, Suldal, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT           v.  Nils Jonson was born in 1670 in Hiim, Sand, Rogaland, NOR and died in 1748 in Vidvei, Suldal, Rogaland, NOR at age 78. Nils married Torgersdotter circa 1700 in Suldal kyrkje, Suldal, Rogaland, NOR.  215      vi.  Ann
2 CONC a Jonsdotter. Anna married Mikkel Toreson in 1703 in Sand kyrkje, Sand, Rogaland, NOR. 
