1 NAME Ola Torsteinsson /Hallingstad/
2 GIVN Ola Torsteinsson
2 SURN Hallingstad
2 _MARNM Haug
1 NAME Ola Torsteinson /Hallingstad/
2 GIVN Ola Torsteinson
2 SURN Hallingstad
2 _MARNM Haug
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1568
2 PLAC Hallingstad øvre, Vikedal
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
