2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/149250605/albert-fristad
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Albert Fristad''' 
2 CONT BIRTH	15 Apr 1885 Norway 
2 CONT DEATH	2 Aug 1945 (aged 60) Peoria, Peoria County, Illinois, USA 
2 CONT BURIAL	 Springdale Cemetery and Mausoleum Peoria, Peoria County, Illinois, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Ole Fristad and Aletta Tunheim. He first married Anna Anderson in Rainsville, Dawson Co, MT, on 24 or 28 Sep 1908. He lived in Mandan, ND, in 1918. In 1925, he and Anna lived in Mandan with children: Arthur (1909), Arnold (
2 CONC 1910), Alma (1916), Victor (1919), and Ada (1921). In Rockford by 1927, and Peoria, by 1937. He was a brick mason.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses:
2 CONT Anna Fristad 1883–1927 (m. 1908)
2 CONT Katherine LaVerne King Fristad 1885–1952
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT Alma L. Fristad Olson 1916–2007
2 CONT Ada Marie Fristad 1921–1940
